OL,5,G0415 A Place in the Sun
OL,6,     FJo and Neil are starting a new
OL,7,     Flife in Lecce, southern Italy, and
OL,8,     Fwant a property that's close to
OL,9,     Fthe beach with a guest annexe.
OL,10,     FJasmine Harman shows them what
OL,11,     Ftheir #200k can buy.
OL,12,G0445 Kirstie and Phil's Love It or...
OL,13,     F...List It: Kirstie Allsopp and
OL,14,     FPhil Spencer meet the Lindleys,
OL,15,     Fwho are torn over their bungalow
OL,16,     Fin Ashtead, Surrey. Pippa dreams
OL,17,     Fof moving to Kent but Bill's
OL,18,     Fhaving none of it.
